   "key": "scene_02",
   "text": "Two new coaches, one group. Jürgen Klopp and Xavi Hernández first met in Amsterdam, and it ended 1-1. Before this rematch, Klopp said he relished facing a Netherlands side that likes to play football. His plan was to win, and top the group on head-to-head. The Dutch arrive after a 7-0 win over Greece. But Xavi is thin on options. Brian Brobbey, Virgil van Dijk and Nathan Aké are all out injured.",
