   "key": "scene_03",
   "text": "Three people carry this story. First, Jürgen Klopp, whose first home game as Germany coach ended in a 0-1 defeat to Greece. Tonight he starts Ter Stegen in goal, and Gruda, Wirtz and Scherhant behind Havertz. Second, Florian Wirtz, in the middle of that three. Watch him. And third, on the other side, Denzel Dumfries, in the Dutch back four. We will come back to him.",
