   "key": "scene_04",
   "text": "The first half belongs to Germany. The momentum graph has them on top for 72 percent of it. But it is no siege. Havertz heads a set piece in minute 23, and it is saved. Scherhant hits the post in minute 32. And the best chance of the half is still Malen's miss. Then, minute 41. Joshua Kimmich finds Derry Scherhant, who finishes with his right foot, from open play. The chance is worth 0.03 xG. Almost nothing. It goes in. 1-0. Germany take a scrap. The Dutch spurned a 0.69. Hold on to that.",
