   "key": "short_1",
   "text": "Brajan Gruda's 9.2 was the best rating on the pitch in Berlin. Germany led 2-0 when his pass set up Schlotterbeck's header in the 65th minute. 3-0. Six minutes later, Gruda set up Wirtz for the fourth. 4-0. Then he scored himself, with his left foot, for 5-0. One goal, two assists. Wirtz scored twice and was rated 9.0. Gruda still finished above him. Klopp said, \"I wouldn't have dared to wish for a 5-0 before the game.\" Who was your man of the match? Full story on the channel.",
